{"parse": {"title": "SC-22", "pageid": 93647, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/SC-21\" title=\"SC-21\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">SC-22</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">SC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">22</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A0.E7.BD.B2.E5.90.8D.E8.AE.BF.E5.AE.A2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"无署名访客\">无署名访客</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 无署名访客</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Anonymous Visitor</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>慰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>问<span class=\"color-value\"></span>者<span class=\"color-value\"></span>留<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>花<span class=\"color-value\"></span>束<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>渐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>趋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>腐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>坏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2510122</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>斯考特……斯考特……奇怪，难道不是这个方向吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>抱歉打扰一下，请问康斯坦丝·斯考特的病房是在哪里？<br />我有些迷路了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>哦，那间病房并不在这个区域。<br />您需要从这里向前走，在拐角处左拐，再在下一个拐角处向右。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>向前，向左，再向右……好的，我记住了。<br />谢谢您！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>不客气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身着亮黄色外套、顶着显眼机械脑袋的少女道过谢后，口中不断重复着方才得知的路线，迈步走开。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——但她走到一半，忽然停下了脚步，疑惑地回头看了一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>奇怪。<br />刚才的那名医生，我是不是曾经和她说过话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>……不对，应该是我又记错了吧？<br />上次的那位女士应该更温柔一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绰号“空脑袋”的少女歪了歪头，很快决定将这个小小的疑问从大脑中清空出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>等等！<br />她刚才说怎么走来着？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2f/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"453\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"180\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">神秘学警察Ⅱ：</div><div>抱歉，医生。<br />但如果我没有记错，现在还不到要例行检查的时间？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>是呀。昨天的体检报告出来了，数据上有一些波动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>虽然可能并无大碍，但我们还是需要确认一下病人的状态作确定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">神秘学警察Ⅱ：</div><div>请稍等，我向您的上级确认一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>我理解，警官。<br />没有什么比小心谨慎行事更重要的了，毕竟里面的可是重要的案件相关人员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">神秘学警察Ⅱ：</div><div>是啊。<br />多谢您的理……解……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">神秘学警察Ⅱ：</div><div>唔……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隔着门板传来的对话声，中断在了一个并不自然的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病床上双手被铐在栏杆上的患者本百无聊赖地盯着窗外，但意识到这一点后，她不禁收回目光，望向紧闭的房门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-631213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-631213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-631213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>……怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门外不再传来声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>数秒后，门把转动，她病房的房门被轻轻地打开。<br />站在门口的是一个她隐约有些印象的普通医生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>您好，斯考特小姐。今天您感觉如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-632002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">神秘学警察Ⅱ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但在门被重新关上之前，斯考特瞥见站在门口的神秘学警察直视着前方，没有分给这个方向半点余光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——有什么地方不对劲。斯考特立刻直起了身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>你是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>有人让我给您送来这束花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>花？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她这才注意到女医生的手上捧着一只玻璃花瓶，插在里面的白色花束洁净无瑕，清新动人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-631214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-631214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-631214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>不对……这太奇怪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-631214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-631214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-631214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>我听到你和那个警员的对话了，刚才你还说你是来给我检查身体状况的，但拿着一只花瓶要怎么检——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-631213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-631213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-631213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>……查…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯考特隐约听到自己的声音也被吞没了，但她无暇顾及。<br />因为她的全部注意力，都伴随着她的视线钉在了那只花瓶的身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不是花，而是花瓶。明明看起来只是寻常的玻璃制品，在阳光的照射下，却如同水晶般美丽，折射出梦幻般的色彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>就像是……水晶……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>头脑中阻隔着一部分记忆的高墙，如同肥皂泡般“啵”的一声破碎、消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>……是您，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>您说过除非出了什么意外，否则您不会再联系我了。<br />是出了什么事吗？是出售给您的那样东西有什么毛病吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不，它很完美，你帮了我大忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>这是我的荣幸，女士。<br />另外我必须要感叹您的高瞻远瞩，您真是料事如神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>我失手了，被夜巡特遣的人抓住了……但他们并没有问出什么东西，因为我根本不记得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>但你看起来仍然身处麻烦之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>呃，是的……但您不用担心！<br />我会想办法解决的，这点小事，不用劳烦您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>那就再好不过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传信术的对面不再传来声音了。若不是自花瓶中仍折射出令她隐隐头晕目眩的光，她也许会以为对方已经切断了这仅被允许单方面发起的通讯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>对了！前些天，我还遇到了玛蒂尔达小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>她……很担心您。您并没有将您的近况告知她吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>没有这个必要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>如果她能更坚强和更敏锐一些，那么她便能够自己发现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方听上去并不如斯考特所想的那样，对这个话题感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这让斯考特在心中窃喜，却也不得不绞尽脑汁，寻找着下一个能够多少延长这场对话的借口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——但实际上，已经没有这个必要了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>视野中的色彩扭曲了，意识开始旋转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>我要……做什么来着？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我这次联系你，是为了向你表示感谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>谢谢你，斯考特小姐。<br />同时请相信我，你绝不像是你内心自认为的那样愚钝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从房间中某处色彩与光线不自然地扭曲的位置上，传来一名女子的声音。<br />清雅，高贵，似曾相识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>你是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个声音没有回答她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>但那些黑色猎犬的鼻子比我想象中的还要灵敏。<br />我想我们的关系就要到此为止了——因此这一次，我也是来道别的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-632701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>再见了，斯考特小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-631215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>等等——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2f/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"453\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"180\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>子弹将玻璃花瓶击成了碎片，梦与现实一同破碎，撒落一地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病房的房门不知何时，已经悄无声息地打开了。一双黑色的皮靴踏着碎落满地的花瓶碎片，来到昏厥的斯考特病床前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>跑得还挺快。<br />看来这条鱼比我们想象中的还要大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>怎么样，他们两个情况如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身着漆黑制服的女子回过头，看向身后的副手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同样身着漆黑制服的男子，正将方才造访这间病房的医生，与原本守在门外的神秘学警察扶到一旁。他们同样已经陷入了昏睡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>中了某种催眠术，施术者水平相当高，无法回溯，恐怕查不出来什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>哦？不错……相当不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女子俯身捡起地上的一片玻璃碎片，勾起唇角连连点头。<br />这引发了一旁副手的不满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>还不错呢？这一次费了这样大的周章，明明早知道斯考特就是犯人，还非要将计就计，用她引出什么“背后的人”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>这下好了吧！<br />斯考特让那个罪魁祸首消除了记忆，这条线等于是断了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>而且我早就说过，没有必要特意瞒着梁。她也是你带的学徒，既然她刚巧在洛杉矶这边实习，让她协助我们显然是个更好的主意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>哼，我到时要看看，等她知道这一切的来龙去脉后，你要怎么和她交代！<br />话说在前面，这次我可不会为你说好话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对副手的指责，女子却一脸无辜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>什么怎么交代？<br />这些都是对她的考验呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>我们的计划原本就是“引蛇出洞”。若是告诉了梁，她的行动就必然会出现不自然的地方，搞不好就会打草惊蛇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>再说本来这次的实习项目，考察的就是她是否能够在没有其他执夜人支援的情况下独当一面——而她也通过这次的事情证明了，她可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>我看那些神秘学犯罪科的家伙挺喜欢她的，那个警长嘴上不说，最后一定也会给她个不错的评价。这不是挺好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>唉，作为她的导师，我可是用心良苦。<br />你不要把我说得像是什么不负责任的人一样呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女子装模做样地摆出了一副痛心的表情，这让她的副手没忍住翻了一个白眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>别这样嘛，这次的事件我已经有头绪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>……你的意思是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女子收起了方才胡闹的神色，扬起嘴角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>这是一条大鱼，我们的线不够结实，让那家伙跑了——但光是确认了这塘池子里有这么一条庞然大物的存在，这次就已经收获颇丰了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>包括这次将唐人街弄得天翻地覆的那盘胶片，以及那个在圣保罗被司辰打了个稀巴烂的发条玩具，一共有五件神秘学管理品失窃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>告诉我，鲍勃。<br />你觉得我们在追查的那名幕后黑手，是这五个东西都需要吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>我叫阿兰，不叫鲍勃！<br />你到底什么时候能够记住？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>……我的答案是，不。那个发条玩具已经报废，这次的胶片也成功被我那名前途无量的小师妹回收。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>它们的确惹出了不少麻烦，但我看不出它们引发的事件之间有什么共通之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>你说得对，布莱恩。<br />它们明显是陪跑，是障眼法，是无关紧要的弃子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>我叫阿兰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女子没有理会副手的纠正，继续侃侃而谈了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div><i>夫藏木于林，人皆视而不见……</i><br />我们的幕后黑手在那五件东西之中，真正想要的恐怕也只有一件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>猜猜看，巴克。最有可能的是哪一个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>我叫阿兰，不是B，是A……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>副手一边无奈地反驳，一边思索了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>剩下的三件物品中最有可能的……等等，难道是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>你猜对了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从自己副手瞬间难看起来的脸色中，判断出对方找到了那个答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>但那个传说是真的吗？它真的能够用在“那个”仪式中？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>现在看来，恐怕是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>……所以，是重塑之手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他念出那个名字，表情凝重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>至少是能够查阅到神秘学藏品管理部档案，甚至是能够拿到藏品管理部防护术式机密文件的基金会高层中——有重塑之手的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>这倒不一定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女子摸了摸下巴，给出了一个令自己的副手再次大跌眼镜的答复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>什么？可……难道除了他们之外，还有其他势力有动机举行“那个仪式”，同时具有从基金会的眼皮底下盗走东西的能力？我实在不这么认为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>东西应当最终是要去向重塑之手没错，但我们的这只老鼠……我想他，或是她却不一定完全和重塑之手站在同一阵线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>重塑之手一度相当重用那个用发条玩具唤出的恶魔，明眼人都看得出她的价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>如果我们的嫌疑人完全效忠于重塑之手，那件封印物就不会辗转一番才来到启明会的人手中了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>虽然与重塑之手有所勾结，但我们追踪的那位恐怕亦有着自己的目的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女子扬起嘴角，将手中的那枚玻璃碎片弹飞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>事情开始有趣起来了，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>所以我才说——这相当不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻后，两个黑衣人的身影从病房中消失了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "SC-22"}}